// Ghidra 12.2 export for AArch64 at -O1 with "Simplify bitfield access" on.
// tri_get_b is a ZPULL of bits 5..16 from a 3-byte LOAD (undefined3).  The
// lifter asked for an unsigned type of exactly 24 bits, found none, dropped
// the ZPULL and the COPY that used it, and returned nothing from a function
// that returns a value, with exit code 0.
//
// A 3-byte value is carried in a 4-byte integer (`typedef int undefined3`).
// The operand keeps that carrier, and the bit range is checked against the
// 24 bits of the operand.
//
